{"channelId":"UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","row":["Paul Owens, the Original Dog Whisperer",1280,"This is the official YouTube channel for Paul Owens, the Original Dog Whisperer, the non-violent and compassionate puppy and dog training expert for over 40 years and best-selling author of the Original Dog Whisperer & Puppy Whisperer books and DVDs.\n\nOwens teaches only positive, non-force training methods and is nationally recognized as a leading proponent of nonviolent training. Coupling scientifically-proven methods with kindness, respect and compassion, this state-of-the-art training proves that there is no need for jerking, hitting, pinning, shocking or shaking to get reliable behavior.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:13.219Z","channelId":"UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"3cf7b3839fd11a88762a0257cbf98a7670e7f8b19d07b5340b88a29f6879e324","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"12fed7efe8576cbb7d122d765b6d8f95acd3dd18f2b0d0948680d7b5ffd03aa9"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1280,"raw":"1.28K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5UHEh_IkrhcU4bT3zzgo3g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:13.219Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Whisperer, the non-violent and compassionate puppy and dog training exp